<Base title="Contact — The Gentle AI Guide" description="How to reach The Gentle AI Guide with a question, a correction, or an idea for an article.">
  <article class="article">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="lede">One address, read by a person: <a href="mailto:hello@gentleaiguide.com">hello@gentleaiguide.com</a></p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Write to us if…</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Something is unclear.</strong> If you met a word we didn't explain, that's our mistake. Tell us which article and which word.</li>
        <li><strong>Something is wrong.</strong> We correct mistakes openly — see <a href="/corrections/">Corrections</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>You have a question we haven't answered.</strong> Questions from readers often become articles.</li>
        <li><strong>You'd like to say hello.</strong> That's fine too.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What to expect</h2>
      <p>We usually reply within a few days. We don't add you to any list, and we don't share your address. We can't give personal medical, legal or financial advice — but we can often point you to who can.</p>
      <h2>Please don't send</h2>
      <p>Passwords, account numbers or other people's private details. We don't need them, and email isn't the place for them. (<a href="/guides/never-type-this/">Here's the full list.</a>)</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
